地将连日来的怒火尽数咆哮出声。其他将领则在一旁默不作声，各怀心思，皆是面色凝重，李肃素来耿直，他能忍耐如此之久，已属极限。昨日摄政王孤身离开，后得知摄政王遇袭，却并未出兵支援，反倒是如获大赦般地自在，索性将连日来憋闷的怨气与恨意尽数散去，就差敲锣打鼓庆贺一番，还未曾喜上眉梢，却见他驾马而归，看似安然无恙。他竟未死，这便意味着，昨日之事摄政王必定不会善罢甘休，这军营怕是要血流成河，只是可怜他们这些誓死效忠的英勇将士们，到最后不是死于战场，而是死于暴君之手，想来便觉无比心寒，直呼凤国亡矣。李肃说得越发激愤，却不知此刻他口中的摄政王正巧行至营帐外，将他叫嚣之言悉数听入耳内，本欲继续，忽听得一声冷嗤，便觉后背发冷，一阵寒风吹过，胸口一痛，人已被丢出五里之外，而这方向便是昨日摄政王遇袭之地。须臾间，凤傲天已然肃立与营帐中央，薄唇轻抿，凤眸冷寒，宛若黑夜中的鹰，冷傲孤清却又盛气逼人，孑然独立间散发的是傲视天地的强势。端坐于议事厅内的众将领，除了震惊便是诧异，摄政王为何来此？这连日来，可是第一次前来议事厅，犹记得第一日摄政王行至军营时，入过议事厅，后来，便在未踏入此处半步，可是，为何今日会前来？“大胆，见王爷还不行礼？”四喜见众人傻愣在原处，提着嗓子威慑道。此时，众人才将心思自四喜尖锐的嗓音中回神，收敛起满腹的疑惑，齐齐跪与地上道，“末将等参见摄政王，千岁千岁千千岁。”凤傲天并未答话，刚才那人所言许是这军营中将士的心声，即便以往这凤傲天犯下如何滔天大罪，如今的她既然成为了凤傲天，便不容任何人敢向她示威，对她公然藐视。议事厅内，随着凤傲天的驾临，气温瞬间降至寒冬腊月，所有事物戛然而止，众人顿觉脊背发冷。凤傲天沉默良久，一言不发，越是如此，众人似是历经了冰寒九重天般，冷若刺骨，心中无不哀嚎，今日怕是在劫难逃。“好一句‘天要亡我凤国’……”冷若寒潭地声音，如同破冰的冰剑，直插入跪在他脚下的众将领耳中，凤傲天矗立不动，居高临下地漠视着，“本王怎不知自个还有这等本事？”“王爷恕罪！”众将领听闻，顿时一惊，适才李肃的豪言壮语怕是被这魔王尽数听了进去，看来，他们今日算是大限已到。“恕罪？”凤傲天挑眉，薄唇一勾，“你等何罪之有？”“王爷，李校尉口无遮拦，一时口快，才酿成大祸，还请王爷看在如今用人在即，给他一个将功赎罪的机会。”求情的乃是中郎将玑柏，冷将军不在军中这两年，军中事务皆由他掌管调配。凤傲天凤眸微调，寒意更甚，“可知昨日那栖国不长眼的东西，一时口快，本王是如何处置的？”玑柏本欲再求情，听摄政王如此一言，随即住口，摄政王的手段，若是他未来之时，他们亦是道听途说，可是，这些时日，他们乃是亲眼所见，手段残暴，令人发指。“四喜，以往敢对本王不敬者，该如何？”凤傲天话语一落，抬起右手在空中打了一个响指，便见在隐处护卫的魂魄二人便飞身离开。“轻者剥皮拆骨，行炮烙之刑；重则五马分尸，再将尸身剁成肉酱，供御狼所用。”四喜在宫中已是见怪不怪，对此事更是习以为常，依他所言，不过是其中最常见罢了，更恐怖的他还未说出。玑柏与其他将领听罢之后，即便是奋勇杀敌，杀人如麻，战场上那些残骸血腥已是所见无数，身经百战的他们，如今亦是吓得两腿发颤，手脚冰冷，不寒而栗。众人低垂着头，冷汗淋漓，只听得“噗通”一声响，便看见李肃被丢入了营帐，两眼发直，吓得面色惨白，魁梧的体魄，如今却瘫软地爬在地上，惊恐万状。“林中的景色可美？”凤傲天倨傲地负手而立，凤眸微眯，冷视着已经被吓傻的李肃。李肃抬眸，恍惚地将目光落在凤傲天身上，顿时自地上爬起，跪在地上，颤颤巍巍道，“请王爷赐末将死罪！”林中到处皆是血肉模糊的累累白骨，但是这般一见，便知当时的惨状有多可怕，如今，他已七魂吓了五魄，若是死，便让他死个痛快，他也不愿生不如死。玑柏等人抬眸，看向李肃，眸光一滞，了事李肃心高气傲，即便是血溅当场，也不会向这摄政王低头，如此这般，定然是适才目睹了什么？想到此，更是心惊胆颤，故作一副赴死状，等待着摄政王的宣判。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－喵呜……亲耐哒们，喜欢的记得收藏哦！嘿嘿……美男如云啊，吼吼……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/yetaicanbao/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Volume 1: Regency 004 What should I do if I disrespect my king? In the meeting hall, Li Su recalled what had happened in the past few days and witnessed with his own eyes the soldiers who had gone through life and death with him. They were all hard-blooded men who were supposed to risk their lives to protect their home and country. In just six days, thousands of people were killed and tortured to death. Even if there are survivors, life is worse than death. This was a military camp with strict military discipline and a solemn atmosphere of murder. It was suddenly transformed into a place where the regent had fun with fireworks. He, Li Su, was originally a reckless man, but he knew that his patience in the past few days had reached his limit. If this continued, he would not let the Feng Kingdom be destroyed in one day, even if he fought to his death. Remember how majestic and majestic Marshal Leng was when he led them in a bloody battle? The old marshal died in the battle, and General Leng fought for his father. He used his troops like a god, which made Qi Kingdom dare not step into the territory of Feng Kingdom. Fortunately, now, I didn't know that the regent was tired of playing with weak men, so he changed his taste and summoned General Leng back to the capital with three imperial edicts every day. In desperation, he had no choice but to return to the capital with the edict to resume his duties. Unexpectedly, there was no news after entering the regent's palace. General Leng already knew the regent's thoughts at that time, so before leaving, he ordered the border officers to guard the border to the death and not to leave even half a step. Li Su held the saber in one hand and clenched it into a fist with the other. His eyes were about to burst, and he roared out all the anger he had accumulated in the past few days with arrogance. The other generals were silent on the sidelines, each with their own thoughts and serious expressions on their faces. Li Su had always been upright, and his ability to endure for so long was already the limit. Yesterday, the regent left alone. When he learned that the regent was attacked, he did not send troops to support him. Instead, he felt as comfortable as if he had received an amnesty. He simply dispersed all the resentment and hatred that he had been holding back for the past few days. He just celebrated with beating gongs and drums. Before he was overjoyed, he saw him returning on horseback, seemingly safe and sound. He was not dead, which meant that the regent would definitely not let go of what happened yesterday. This military camp was probably going to be a river of blood. It was just pity for these brave soldiers who swore loyalty to the death. In the end, they died not on the battlefield, but at the hands of the tyrant. Just thinking about it made me feel extremely chilled and called Feng Kingdom dead. Li Su spoke more and more angrily, but he didn't know that the regent he was talking about happened to be outside the camp at this moment, and heard all his shouting words. He was about to continue, but suddenly heard a cold scoff, and felt a chill on his back, a gust of cold wind blew by, and his chest hurt. He had been thrown five miles away, and this direction was the place where the regent was attacked yesterday. In an instant, Feng Aotian stood solemnly in the center of the camp, her thin lips pursed slightly, her phoenix eyes cold, like an eagle in the dark night. She was cold, aloof and solemn, yet powerful, and her loneliness exuded a strength that was arrogant to the world. The generals sitting in the meeting hall were shocked and surprised. Why did the regent come here? This is the first time I have come to the meeting hall in the past few days. I still remember that the regent entered the meeting hall when he arrived at the military camp on the first day. Afterwards, he did not even step foot here. But why did he come here today? \"How dare you, why don't you be polite to the prince?\" Si Xi saw everyone dumbfounded and threatened them with a raised voice. At this time, everyone recovered their thoughts from Si Xi's sharp voice, suppressed their doubts, and all knelt down on the ground and said, \"I will wait until I see the regent, a thousand years old.\" Feng Aotian did not answer. What the man just said may be the voice of the military camp lieutenant. Even if Feng Aotian committed such heinous crimes in the past, now that she has become Feng Aotian, no one will dare to demonstrate to her or openly despise her. In the meeting hall, with the arrival of Feng Aotian, the temperature instantly dropped to the cold winter months, everything came to an abrupt stop, and everyone suddenly felt a chill down their spines. Feng Aotian was silent for a long time, without saying a word. The more this happened, everyone seemed to have experienced the ninth level of ice and cold. They were as cold as the bone, and they all wailed in their hearts. They were afraid that they would be doomed today. \"What a saying, 'Heaven is going to destroy our Feng Kingdom'...\" Leng Ruohantan's voice, like an ice sword breaking through the ice, penetrated directly into the ears of the generals kneeling at his feet. Feng Aotian stood motionless, looking down on him with indifference, \"This king How could I not know that I still have such ability?\" \"My lord, forgive me!\" The generals were shocked when they heard that Li Su's heroic words just now were probably heard by this demon king. It seems that their deadline has come today. \"Forgive me?\" Feng Aotian raised his eyebrows and curled his thin lips, \"What kind of crime do you think you are guilty of?\" \"Your Majesty, Lieutenant Li spoke unobstructedly, and it was his quick words that led to a catastrophe. Please see that he is about to be employed and give him a chance to atone for his sins.\" The one who begged for mercy was Zhonglang General Ji Bai. In the two years since General Leng was absent from the army, he had been in charge of military affairs. Feng Aotian's phoenix eyes adjusted slightly, and the chill became even greater, \"Do you know how the king dealt with the blind thing in Qi Kingdom yesterday when he spoke quickly?\" Jibai wanted to plead again, but after hearing the regent's words, he immediately stopped. If the regent's methods were his in the future, they would have only heard about it, but these days, they have seen it with their own eyes, and the methods are cruel and outrageous. \"Sixi, what should happen to those who dared to be disrespectful to me in the past?\" As soon as Feng Aotian finished speaking, he raised his right hand and snapped his fingers in the air. Then he saw the two souls guarding him in the hidden place and flew away. \"The light ones are skinned and deboned, and burned with cannons; the more serious ones are divided into five horses, and then chopped into meat paste for the use of wolves.\" Si Xi was already familiar with this in the palace, and he was even more accustomed to this matter. According to him, it was just the most common among them, and he had yet to say what was even more terrifying. After Ji Bai and the other generals heard this, even though they fought bravely to kill the enemy, they saw countless bloody corpses on the battlefield. After hundreds of battles, they were still so scared that their legs were shaking, their hands and feet were cold, and they were trembling. Everyone lowered their heads, dripping with cold sweat. They heard a \"pop\" sound and saw Li Su being thrown into the tent. Their eyes were straight and their faces were pale with fear.", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}